  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Truths or Lies?\r\n\r\nThis is the same AI chatbot that wrote the statements from the warm up. Time to find out whether you can trust what it tells you.\r\n\r\n##### PART 1: Ask the bot\r\n1. Ask the chatbot to give you information about octopuses.\r\n2. Look at the facts it gives you. Do you think they're all true? Try to find out. \r\n\r\n##### PART 2: Give the bot some context\r\n3. Click \"Add file\" → \"From Library\" and attach the **Octopus Fact Sheet**.\r\n4. Ask the bot about the facts it gave you earlier. Make sure to tell it to use the attached document.\r\n5. Figure it out: Were any statements false?\r\n\r\n##### Talk with your partner: \r\nThe bot didn't change — so why are its answers so different now?\r\n",
